msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your registration "
"exactly, save, and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Si Spotify affiche « Invalid redirect URI », ajoutez {uri} tel quel à votre "
"inscription, enregistrez, puis reconnectez-vous."

#: src/ui/login.rs:360
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "Se connecter avec Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:371
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous dans votre navigateur. Spotifast ne voit jamais votre mot de "
"passe. La lecture locale nécessite Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:380
msgid "How to register Spotifast"
msgstr "Comment inscrire Spotifast"

#: src/ui/login.rs:404
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres du proxy"

