msgstr "Spotify est lent sur la connexion partagée."

#: src/ui/mod.rs:492
msgid ""
"Spotifast no longer offers the shared sign-in, and Spotify can stop "
"accepting it at any time. Register Spotifast and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast ne propose plus la connexion partagée, et Spotify peut cesser de "
"l’accepter à tout moment. Inscrivez Spotifast et vous n’aurez plus à "
"attendre."

